      "type": "text",
      "text": "IL-23 inhibitors: tildrakizumab, risankizumab, guselkumab; ustekinumab targets IL-12 and IL-23. IL-17 inhibitors: secukinumab, ixekizumab, bimekizumab, brodalumab"
