    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Apremilast (oral PDE4 inhibitor): data suggest it is less effective than biologics; deucravacitinib (oral TYK2 inhibitor) is effective; spesolimab (IL-36 inhibitor) treats generalized pustular psoriasis"
     }
